// Delve depth maps. Generated by a tunnel generator kept outside the repo, so
// every row stays the same length; edit the route there rather than by hand.
//
// Legend
//   #  rock                    .  open cave            =  one-way plank
//   ^  spikes (heavy damage)   ~  lava (heavy damage)  v  bottomless pit (kills)
//   m  glow-moss on the main route (open cave)         @  run start
//   X  descent hole (sealed until the Warden falls on a boss depth)
//   b  beacon (full heal, once)                        h  resting life spark
//   T  lift, top stop (three wide)                     t  lift, bottom stop
//   C  crawler   B  bat   S  spitter   R  brute   N  grub nest   W  Warden
//
// Per-run variant spots, rolled from the run seed:
//   L  rock that turns to lava about 8% of the time (never the only foothold)
//   J  staircase block, or open cave when its group rolls a jump pad
//   P  the pad of that group: a jump pad, or plain rock under the staircase
//   ?  enemy slot: empty, or one of the depth's "roll" types
//   *  crystal slot: a random timed powerup, or nothing
//   $  permanent crystal: Splitter or Ricochet

